OL,3,CBodies found as search continues for
OL,4,C10 missing after Pakistan avalanche
OL,6,FPakistani rescuers have recovered four
OL,7,Fbodies and are continuing to search
OL,8,Ffor six other climbers after an
OL,9,Favalanche struck Broad Peak in the
OL,10,Fcountry's north.
OL,12,FEfforts to retrieve the bodies were
OL,13,Fcontinuing despite harsh weather
OL,14,Fconditions, according to senior
OL,15,Fgovernment officials.
OL,17,F"The team has been out of
OL,18,Fcommunication since Thursday," Karrar
OL,19,FHaidri, vice president of the Alpine
OL,20,FClub of Pakistan, said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
