OL,3,CBodies found as search continues for
OL,4,C10 missing after Pakistan avalanche
OL,6,FHe added that Pakistan Army
OL,7,Fhelicopters had joined the search and
OL,8,Frescue operation and that authorities
OL,9,Fwere in contact with the families of
OL,10,Fthe missing climbers.
OL,12,FA British citizen is among the 10
OL,13,Fmountaineers caught up in the
OL,14,Favalanche.
OL,16,FNirmal Purja, who was born in Nepal
OL,17,Fand previously served in the British
OL,18,FArmy and Royal Marines, was leading
OL,19,Fthe expedition on the world's 12th-
OL,20,Fhighest mountain when the avalanche
OL,21,Fstruck at around midday on Thursday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
