OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785502109
OL,3,CBodies found as search continues for
OL,4,C10 missing after Pakistan avalanche
OL,6,FThe Alpine Club of Pakistan (ACP) said
OL,7,Fthere had been no contact with any of
OL,8,Fthe climbers since the avalanche.
OL,10,FAccording to the ACP, the expedition
OL,11,Fincluded five Nepali climbers,
OL,12,FPakistani mountaineer Sohail Sakhi
OL,13,Ffrom Hunza, Omani climber Nathira,
OL,14,FAmerican climber Mallory Geis, a
OL,15,FChinese climber identified only as
OL,16,FWang, and another foreign climber
OL,17,Fwhose nationality has not been
OL,18,Fdisclosed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
