OL,3,CBodies found as search continues for
OL,4,C10 missing after Pakistan avalanche
OL,6,FMr Purja rose to international
OL,7,Fprominence in 2019 after climbing all
OL,8,F14 of the world's mountains with peaks
OL,9,Fabove 8,000 metres in just 189 days,
OL,10,Fbreaking the previous record for
OL,11,Fcompleting the feat by more than seven
OL,12,Fyears.
OL,14,FHe is one of five Nepalese climbers in
OL,15,Fthe group, alongside mountaineers from
OL,16,FPakistan, Oman, the US and China, as
OL,17,Fwell as one foreign national whose
OL,18,Fcountry has not been disclosed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
