OL,3,CBodies found as search continues for
OL,4,C10 missing after Pakistan avalanche
OL,6,FAlpine Club of Pakistan President
OL,7,FMajor General Irfan Arshad is in
OL,8,Fcontact with government officials to
OL,9,F"facilitate an immediate search and
OL,10,Frescue operation," the organisation
OL,11,Fsaid in a statement.
OL,13,FThe statement said: "The Alpine Club
OL,14,Fof Pakistan (ACP) has received deeply
OL,15,Fconcerning reports of an avalanche
OL,16,Fthat struck a team of climbers on
OL,17,FBroad Peak (8,047m) in the Karakoram
OL,18,Fmountain range around midday today.
