OL,3,CBodies found as search continues for
OL,4,C10 missing after Pakistan avalanche
OL,6,F"President of the Alpine Club of
OL,7,FPakistan, Major General Irfan Arshad,
OL,8,FHI(M), along with the senior
OL,9,Fleadership of the club, is in constant
OL,10,Fcontact with the highest government
OL,11,Fauthorities and all relevant agencies
OL,12,Fto facilitate an immediate search and
OL,13,Frescue operation.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
