OL,3,CBodies found as search continues for
OL,4,C10 missing after Pakistan avalanche
OL,6,F"Every possible effort is being made
OL,7,Fto ensure that helicopter support and
OL,8,Fall available rescue resources are
OL,9,Fmobilised at the earliest opportunity,
OL,10,Fsubject to weather and operational
OL,11,Fconditions.
OL,13,F"The Alpine Club of Pakistan is
OL,14,Fclosely monitoring the situation and
OL,15,Fcoordinating with all concerned
OL,16,Fstakeholders.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
