OL,3,CBodies found as search continues for
OL,4,C10 missing after Pakistan avalanche
OL,6,F"The club prays for the safety and
OL,7,Fsuccessful rescue of all the climbers
OL,8,Fand stands in solidarity with their
OL,9,Ffamilies and the international
OL,10,Fmountaineering community during this
OL,11,Fdifficult time."
